#: ../../airtable_catalog_stats.md:13 cda2e5e89d1f439a9ae1129014763c54
msgid "What it does"
msgstr ""

#: ../../airtable_catalog_stats.md:15 3aff273680f4461daa27e3dbac53cb99
msgid ""
"A broad, Shopify-independent scrape of the whole catalog: how big it is, "
"how it's shaped (variants per model, units per variant), a couple of "
"catalog-hygiene signals, and how all of that is changing day over day. "
"Where "
"[`shopify_catalog_reconciliation`](shopify_catalog_reconciliation.md) "
"asks \"does Shopify match Airtable for the things we sell online\", this "
"script doesn't compare against Shopify at all -- it's purely about the "
"catalog's own shape and growth, useful for spotting things like data-"
"entry gaps (a Model nobody ever added a Variation to) or just tracking "
"how fast the catalog is growing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../airtable_catalog_stats.md:24 84ce49f5eeb6438c903e0c592433adf2
msgid "Data it fetches"
msgstr ""

#: ../../airtable_catalog_stats.md:46 463b32314d56417b93e3096f063f1c1e
msgid "How it works"
msgstr ""

#: ../../airtable_catalog_stats.md:48 bf5ef2fe0f04432a89cfb09568404eda
msgid ""
"Fetch every Model, Variation, and Unit from Airtable "
"(`api.domain.catalog`, the same module `shopify_catalog_reconciliation` "
"uses)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../airtable_catalog_stats.md:50 57aecaf29d1e46a094b2e886f2fdcbb7
msgid ""
"Compute totals and derived ratios directly from those three lists -- no "
"external calls beyond Airtable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../airtable_catalog_stats.md:52 de6b56b3bf1e41d6937b71e988b2ce40
msgid ""
"Diff the current full sets of Model/Variation/Unit ids against the "
"previous run's snapshot (stored in Redis via `api.run_store.RunStore`, "
"same pattern as `shopify_catalog_reconciliation`) to report how many of "
"each were added since last time. The first run ever (no snapshot yet) "
"reports 0 additions, not the whole catalog."
msgstr ""

#: ../../airtable_catalog_stats.md:57 2d0f9b84b7124305be05fd16d6aaf204
msgid ""
"Live stages (`GET /internal/scripts/airtable_catalog_stats/current`): "
"`fetching_airtable_models`, `fetching_airtable_variations`, "
"`fetching_airtable_units`, `computing_statistics`."
msgstr ""

