#: ../../airtable_catalog_stats.md:77 c98416c5181a4b8598f43cf81ae5556e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This script has no `details` payload (`details` is `{}`) -- every result "
"is a flat number, so each run in `GET "
"/internal/scripts/airtable_catalog_stats/runs` is just `status`, the "
"metrics above, `duration_seconds` and `finished_at`. `GET /metrics` "
"exposes them to Prometheus as "
"`rewake_api_script_metric{script=\"airtable_catalog_stats\", ...}`."
msgstr ""

